# Graphify index output (local-only, regenerable)
/graphify-out/
graphify-out/

# Local reverse-engineering tooling checkout (not project source)
/ghidra-mcp/

# Vendored Rust workspace: build output stays local (source under rust/).
rust/target/

# ai-todo tamper backups (local-only, created by accept_tamper)
.ai-todo/tamper/
